{"resourceIdentifier":"4334","resourceName":"Biogas Project in Cuddalore, India","description":"The proposed project involves establishment of organic waste biorefinery. The project activity produces Bio-CNG and Bio Manure using biodegradable wastes. The purpose of the project activity is to recover and treat various types of organic wastes. The technology used is anaerobic decomposition in a continuous stirred tank reactor. The wastes to be considered under the project activity would have been otherwise openly decayed, leading to a significant quantity of methane emissions in the absence of the project activity. The total capacity of the plant is 90 tons of waste per day. Due to the inherent nature of the project activity the proposed project also contributes to various SDGs.","location":{"latitude":11.721581,"longitude":79.658322},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-07-18","endExclusive":"2023-08-18","endInclusive":"2023-08-17"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4334"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Tamil Nadu"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Global Carbon Solutions"},{"type":"string","value":"Telangana, India"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"4334"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"28669"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.D.,AMS-III.AO.,AMS-III.AQ"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"TÜV SÜD South Asia Private Limited"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"04/10/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"st